{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "mini-clinic-api-v2",
    "name": "Mini Clinic REST API",
    "description": "Dokumentasi lengkap REST API Mini Clinic — mencakup seluruh endpoint minimal yang dipersyaratkan.\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:5000/api`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer Token (JWT). Login untuk mendapatkan token, lalu gunakan sebagai `Authorization: Bearer <token>` di semua endpoint yang memerlukan autentikasi.\n\n**Roles:**\n- `ADMIN` — akses penuh\n- `DOCTOR` — akses modul pemeriksaan & rekam medis\n- `REGISTRATION_OFFICER` — akses pendaftaran & antrian",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "JWT token — diisi otomatis setelah login" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Endpoint autentikasi — login, logout, dan data user aktif.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Login ke sistem. Mengembalikan JWT token.\n\n**Role tersedia:**\n- `admin` / `admin123` → ADMIN\n- `dokter` / `dokter123` → DOCTOR\n- `petugas` / `petugas123` → REGISTRATION_OFFICER"
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": ["const r = pm.response.json();", "if (r.data && r.data.token) {", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', r.data.token);", "  console.log('Token saved:', r.data.token.slice(0,30) + '...');", "}"],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "description": "Logout dari sistem. JWT bersifat stateless — server mengkonfirmasi 200. Client wajib menghapus token dari penyimpanan lokal."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] },
            "description": "Ambil data user yang sedang login."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Patient",
      "description": "CRUD pasien. Setiap pasien mendapat No. Rekam Medis (MRN) otomatis format `RM-0001`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /patients",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/patients?q=&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["patients"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q", "value": "", "description": "Cari berdasarkan nama, NIK, atau MRN" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1", "description": "Halaman (default: 1)" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "Jumlah per halaman (default: 20)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar semua pasien dengan paginasi dan pencarian."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /patients/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/patients/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["patients", "1"] },
            "description": "Detail satu pasien berdasarkan ID."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /patients",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/patients", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["patients"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nik\": \"3271021405900099\",\n  \"name\": \"Siti Rahayu\",\n  \"gender\": \"P\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"1990-05-14\",\n  \"phone\": \"081234567890\",\n  \"address\": \"Jl. Contoh No. 1, Jakarta\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Daftarkan pasien baru. MRN (`RM-XXXX`) dibuat otomatis oleh sistem.\n\n**Validasi:**\n- `nik`: wajib, 16 digit\n- `name`: wajib, min 2 karakter\n- `gender`: `L` atau `P`\n- `birthDate`: format ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`\n- `phone`: min 8 karakter\n- `address`: min 3 karakter"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /patients/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/patients/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["patients", "1"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"089876543210\",\n  \"address\": \"Jl. Baru No. 99, Bandung\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Update data pasien (semua field opsional — partial update)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /patients/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/patients/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["patients", "1"] },
            "description": "Hapus pasien beserta seluruh data terkait (registrasi, rekam medis, resep) secara cascade.\n\n⚠️ **Tidak dapat dibatalkan.**"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Registration",
      "description": "Pendaftaran kunjungan pasien. Setiap registrasi menghasilkan nomor antrian otomatis.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /registrations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/registrations?status=&poliId=&doctorId=&date=",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["registrations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "", "description": "Filter: Menunggu | CheckIn | Pemeriksaan | Selesai" },
                { "key": "poliId", "value": "", "description": "Filter by ID poli" },
                { "key": "doctorId", "value": "", "description": "Filter by ID dokter" },
                { "key": "date", "value": "", "description": "Filter tanggal YYYY-MM-DD" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar semua registrasi dengan filter opsional."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /registrations/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/registrations/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["registrations", "1"] },
            "description": "Detail satu registrasi beserta data pasien, dokter, dan poli."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /registrations",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/registrations", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["registrations"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"patientId\": 1,\n  \"doctorId\": 5,\n  \"poliId\": 4,\n  \"paymentType\": \"BPJS\",\n  \"complaint\": \"Demam dan batuk sejak 3 hari\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Daftarkan kunjungan pasien. Nomor antrian (`A-0001`) dibuat otomatis.\n\n**paymentType:** `BPJS` | `UMUM` | `ASURANSI`\n\n**Status awal:** `Menunggu`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /registrations/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/registrations/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["registrations", "1"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"complaint\": \"Keluhan diperbarui: demam tinggi\",\n  \"paymentType\": \"UMUM\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Update data registrasi (partial update). Semua field opsional."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /registrations/:id/status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/registrations/1/status", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["registrations", "1", "status"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"CheckIn\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Update status registrasi.\n\n**Alur status:** `Menunggu` → `CheckIn` → `Pemeriksaan` → `Selesai`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Queue",
      "description": "Manajemen antrian kunjungan. Endpoint berbasis registrasi dengan semantik khusus antrian.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /queues",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/queues?status=Menunggu&poliId=&doctorId=&date=",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["queues"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "status", "value": "Menunggu", "description": "Default: Menunggu & CheckIn. Bisa spesifik: Menunggu | CheckIn | Pemeriksaan | Selesai" },
                { "key": "poliId", "value": "", "description": "Filter by ID poli" },
                { "key": "doctorId", "value": "", "description": "Filter by ID dokter" },
                { "key": "date", "value": "", "description": "Filter tanggal YYYY-MM-DD (default: semua)" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ambil daftar antrian aktif. Default menampilkan status `Menunggu` dan `CheckIn` terurut dari yang paling awal."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /queues",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/queues", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["queues"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"patientId\": 1,\n  \"doctorId\": 5,\n  \"poliId\": 4,\n  \"paymentType\": \"UMUM\",\n  \"complaint\": \"Kontrol rutin\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Tambahkan pasien ke antrian (sama dengan POST /registrations). Nomor antrian dibuat otomatis."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /queues/:id/call",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/queues/1/call", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["queues", "1", "call"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "description": "Panggil pasien dengan ID tertentu — ubah status menjadi `CheckIn`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /queues/:id/status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/queues/1/status", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["queues", "1", "status"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"Pemeriksaan\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Update status antrian secara manual.\n\n**Nilai valid:** `Menunggu` | `CheckIn` | `Pemeriksaan` | `Selesai`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical Record",
      "description": "Rekam medis SOAP — dibuat saat dokter menyelesaikan pemeriksaan.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /medical-records",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/medical-records", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["medical-records"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"registrationId\": 1,\n  \"patientId\": 1,\n  \"doctorId\": 5,\n  \"subjective\": \"Pasien mengeluh demam tinggi sejak 3 hari, disertai nyeri kepala dan mual.\",\n  \"objective\": \"Pemeriksaan fisik: conjungtiva anemis, akral hangat\",\n  \"bp\": \"120/80\",\n  \"temp\": 38.5,\n  \"weight\": 65,\n  \"height\": 165,\n  \"diagnosis\": \"A90 • Dengue Fever\",\n  \"therapy\": \"Paracetamol 3x500mg, istirahat cukup, minum air putih 2L/hari\",\n  \"actions\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Pemeriksaan Darah Lengkap\", \"cost\": 0 }\n  ],\n  \"prescription\": {\n    \"notes\": \"Resep dokter\",\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"medicine\": \"Paracetamol 500mg\",\n        \"dosage\": \"3x1\",\n        \"qty\": 15,\n        \"instruction\": \"Diminum setelah makan\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Buat rekam medis SOAP baru. Otomatis mengubah status registrasi menjadi `Selesai`.\n\n**Role:** DOCTOR atau ADMIN\n\n**Field wajib:** `registrationId`, `patientId`, `doctorId`, `subjective`, `diagnosis`\n\n**Field opsional:** `objective`, `bp`, `temp`, `weight`, `height`, `therapy`, `actions[]`, `prescription`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /medical-records/:patientId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/medical-records/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["medical-records", "1"] },
            "description": "Ambil semua rekam medis pasien berdasarkan `patientId`. Terurut dari yang terbaru.\n\nMengembalikan data lengkap termasuk tindakan, resep, dan info registrasi (dokter, poli)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /medical-records/registration/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/medical-records/registration/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["medical-records", "registration", "1"] },
            "description": "Ambil rekam medis berdasarkan `registrationId` (satu registrasi = satu rekam medis)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Prescription",
      "description": "Manajemen resep obat. Resep terikat ke rekam medis.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /prescriptions",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/prescriptions", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["prescriptions"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"medicalRecordId\": 1,\n  \"notes\": \"Resep tambahan\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"medicine\": \"Amoxicillin 500mg\",\n      \"dosage\": \"3x1\",\n      \"qty\": 21,\n      \"instruction\": \"Habiskan obat meskipun sudah merasa sembuh\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"medicine\": \"Antasida tablet\",\n      \"dosage\": \"3x1\",\n      \"qty\": 10,\n      \"instruction\": \"Diminum 30 menit sebelum makan\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Buat resep baru untuk rekam medis yang sudah ada.\n\n**Role:** DOCTOR atau ADMIN\n\n**Catatan:** Satu rekam medis hanya bisa memiliki satu resep. Jika sudah ada, akan dikembalikan error 409."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /prescriptions/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/prescriptions/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["prescriptions", "1"] },
            "description": "Detail resep berdasarkan `prescriptionId`, termasuk semua item obat dan info rekam medis."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
